I-peq0\" data-code=\"6n_xCI-peq0\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/6n_xCI-peq0/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2058-nobody","name":"Nobody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-14T17:19:08-08:00","id":340294,"title":"","content":"Obama is about to sign off on a $1.1 trillion spending bill;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://thehill.com/policy/finance/227062-what-the-11-trillion-spending-bill-contains\" target=\"_blank\">What the spending bill contains</a><br /> <i><br /> <b>Wall Street un-reform</b><br /> The bill includes language repealing part of the Dodd-Frank Wall Street reform law that will allow banks covered by the Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation to directly engage in derivatives trading.<br /> This set off the biggest political storm for the legislation, as Sen. Elizabeth Warren (D-Mass.) led a liberal insurrection against the White House, which decided not to fight Republicans over the measure.<br /> Wall Street lobbied for the change, and the bill will be sent to Obama with the language in it.<br /> <br /> <b>Campaign finance</b><br /> The bill also raises the limits on what people can give to political committees each year, greatly increasing the money wealthy people can donate. The provision would allow a wealthy donor to contribute a total of more than $1.55 million to a national party.<br /> House Democratic Leader Nancy Pelosi (D-Calif.) lambasted the change in a floor speech in which she broke with the White House over the bill.<br /> <br /> <b>Body cameras</b><br /> The bill doesn\u2019t contain funding for body cameras for police, which Obama had requested after the outcry over police killings of two black men, and grand jury decisions not to indict the officers involved. The spending package does provide funding for other related community policing programs.<br /> </i><br /> ----------------------<br /> <br /> Big business writing their own laws. (That rider weakening Dodd-Frank was written by Citi Bank's CEO) The bill also includes the Hyde Amendment, which bans all federal funding for abortions.<br /> It's always funny that people call Obama a socialist when he obviously isn't.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-23T05:51:57-08:00","id":348211,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It's always funny that people call Obama a socialist when he obviously isn't. </div> </div> </div>American public is not most knowleadgable in political science.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edite