cussion, as a Greek citizen, is that for a while, a lot of people felt that unsound economic planning justified punishing us like worse than a country guilty of genocide and other war crimes. If it weren't for my mixed, Western European background, I would've turned my back to Europe. So back on topic, I only have one Palestinian friend. She is a very peaceful person and has been at times abused by Israeli people whom we both hope belong to a very vocal, very stupid minority.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.greece-bynight.com\" target=\"_blank\">Greece By Night LARP</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/59-stylanski","name":"stylanski","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar59_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"299"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-01T20:58:44-08:00","id":357175,"title":"","content":"When Eisenhower ran for president in 1956 <a href=\"http://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/ws/?pid=25838\" target=\"_blank\">this was the Republican Party Platform</a> It's sad to see how different it all is today. The current US government seems very much a plutocracy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}